<BaseLayout
  title="Easy Install Rubber Gym Tiles UAE | DIY Gym Flooring Dubai | Rukn Al Zain"
  description="Simple, tool-free interlocking rubber tiles for fast installation, removal, and reuse. Ideal for home gyms, multi-use spaces, and temporary UAE fit-outs."
