              tool-free layout and clean subfloor protection across residential and commercial
              fitness spaces in the UAE. Built with high-density SBR rubber and heat-resistant
              polyurethane binders, these modular puzzle tiles deliver durable impact absorption and
              effortless reusability without permanent glues or specialist tools.
            </p>

